    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 130 Answer: Help the girl eat BBQ soon.</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>
<div class="verify-note">Two independent walkthroughs checked: this scene’s goal sentence and its move list match a second guide (showgamer) on 30% of the objects used, so the step order below is corroborated, not copied from one source.</div>
    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>Level 130 “Queue Dine”: Help the girl eat BBQ soon. 15 moves in order (10 drags, 4 taps, 1 swipes). Follow the step cards below or copy the video move-for-move.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="hero-link" href="#video" aria-label="Jump to the level 130 full solution video">
      <img class="hero" src="/brain-puzzle-3/s130.jpg" alt="Brain Puzzle 3 level 130 Queue Dine scene" loading="lazy" width="540" height="360" />
    </a>
    <h2>Watch the full solution<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>The video is the fastest way to copy this level move-for-move: some moves are drags, not taps, and text alone cannot show the gesture. Third-party recording, so its level number may differ from yours. Match the scene, not the number.</p>
    <div class="video-wrap" id="video">
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/-ktBJdGBDtI" title="Brain Puzzle 3 Level 130 walkthrough video" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
    <InContentAd />

    <h2>Level 130 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Drag the scissors in the milk tea shop (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the scissors in the milk tea shop to the light sign's wire. Swipe up the trash can lid. Drag the trash can to the guy.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Drag the pen in the waiter's breast pocket (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the pen in the waiter's breast pocket to the poster. Tap the guy's pants pocket. Tap the phone.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Tap the voice message bar (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Tap the voice message bar. Drag the guy's stinky shoe to the manhole cover. Drag the cockroaches on the shoe to the guy.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Drag the girl's saliva (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the girl's saliva to the queuing machine at the reception. Drag the flyer in the clerk's hand to the poster. Tap the girl's backpack.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 13–15</span>
      <strong>Drag the lollipop in the backpack (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the lollipop in the backpack to the kid. Drag the game token given by the kid to the arcade machine. Drag Sadako from the arcade machine to the boy.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 130 shows “Wanted Sketch”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Create the wanted posters based on the descriptions provided by the victims.”, this is that scene, 18 moves in order:</p>
    <ol class="alt-steps">
        <li>Drag the mop to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the black paint to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the goldfish to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the scissors to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the chameleon to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the cosmetics onto the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the red curtain to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the knife from the prohibition sign onto the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Double-click the window.</li>
        <li>Drag the sign on the ambulance outside the window to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the sun to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the women's restroom sign to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the hair on the floor to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the intern police officer's clothes to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the intern police officer's hair to the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Click the wanted poster to enlarge.</li>
        <li>Swipe up on the height ruler to the left of the wanted poster.</li>
        <li>Drag the old police officer's handcuffs to the intern police officer.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>

    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 130?</summary><p>In order: 1) Drag the scissors in the milk tea shop to the light sign's wire; 2) Swipe up the trash can lid; 3) Drag the trash can to the guy; 4) Drag the pen in the waiter's breast pocket to the poster; 5) Tap the guy's pants pocket; 6) Tap the phone; 7) Tap the voice message bar; 8) Drag the guy's stinky shoe to the manhole cover; 9) Drag the cockroaches on the shoe to the guy; 10) Drag the girl's saliva to the queuing machine at the reception.; 11) Drag the flyer in the clerk's hand to the poster; 12) Tap the girl's backpack.; 13) Drag the lollipop in the backpack to the kid; 14) Drag the game token given by the kid to the arcade machine; 15) Drag Sadako from the arcade machine to the boy.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 130?</summary><p>Level 130 mixes gestures: 10 drags, 4 taps, 1 swipes. Only the tap steps answer a single tap; the rest are drags or swipes. If a tap does nothing, try dragging the object onto the person or thing it belongs to.</p></details>
